{"v":2,"catch":"艾爾涅亞王國歡迎來自世界各地的移民，請隨時前來展開新生活！享受充滿愛與冒險的自由人生。\n任務、戰鬥、收集道具、農作、戀愛、結婚，甚至是養育孩子…","desc":"一款王國模擬遊戲，在這裡你可以移居到一個幻想中的王國，享受自由自在的生活。\n這是一個讓你隨心所欲探索的奇幻虛擬王國…\n穿越美麗的森林、河川、農場、牧場、礦場、學校、教堂和城堡。\n但這還不是全部——王國居民的生活也被細緻地模擬了出來。\n\n來到王國的玩家將會有如在玩一款真實的MMORPG，能夠與居民進行自然的對話互動。\n你可以談戀愛、結婚、生兒育女…甚至連孩子也能有自己的孩子。\n玩家在王國中所度過的每段人生都獨一無二，每一次遊玩都將是截然不同的體驗。\n這不只是一般的遊戲——更是一段會永遠留在你心中的珍貴回憶。","publisher":"althi","release":"2025-07-03","genres":["模擬","角色扮演","交流"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 1.8GB / Switch 1.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a1f76d0df6b02dece248ac52bd3c61c224637217bf83410ebecffa0f65323f1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ba97f9f277f94d6ed296aeda1e5c014e8f39b325d34dde2e8eed8907de46beef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cc35171b652412bfe6979632672edd765e3f73d58f1377c197249559f9bd46cc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c5ae7a11ebcc13e206a04798f523eb0b3c2abfd4480dbb7da609f3d096cec23.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5ffe0c4ccefd07b727ac4c2a37741dbf40d921ab06128044d8ce346c647a8565.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a663fb44b72cefb2e145b65790c9834f5e820f48708dd88fe2baaf0efcd59bd.jpg"],"dlc":[{"id":"70050000059254","name":"Hair Dye Set A ( Lt. Brown, Lavender, Cream, Cherry Blossom )","img":"776b7524dd81bea9285ccd3dd428f4e9df5497001e0105f1fe63dcc2f1d05817","date":"2025-07-17","mem":false},{"id":"70050000059255","name":"Hair Dye Set B ( Pink, Turquoise, Blue Silver, White Sand )","img":"bfedd134963101ee93614c41b0d9b027239e8640f106778557c3a5f1eb09c975","date":"2025-07-17","mem":false},{"id":"70050000059104","name":"Cosmetics set (Magical Makeup,Hair Catalog)","img":"76d730ee95e0eb44b6bd4e7c75f90cd72897941f83051a1d54656f46dfb8fca4","date":"2025-07-10","mem":false}],"dlcTotal":116,"titleId":"01008e9007064000"}